  "settingsMobExtraKeyboardRowHelpBody": "Shows a row of special keys above the on-screen keyboard in the terminal.\n\nIncludes: Esc, Tab, Ctrl, Alt, arrow keys, Home, End, function keys (F1-F12), and more.\n\nThese keys are essential for terminal apps like vim, nano, htop, and tmux that use special key combinations.",
