  "settingsMobScrollableKeyRowHelpBody": "Replaces the two-row layout with a single horizontally-scrollable row of keys.\n\nNo more FN modifier toggle - every key (F1-F12, Page Up/Down, Insert, etc.) is reachable with a single tap.\n\nPair with \"Customize keys\" to hide the keys you never use and shorten the row.",
  "@settingsMobScrollableKeyRowHelpBody": {"description": "Text in the Keyboard and mouse settings on a phone or tablet."},
  "settingsMobScrollableKeyRowDesc": "One-row scrollable layout instead of FN modifier",
  "@settingsMobScrollableKeyRowDesc": {"description": "Text in the Keyboard and mouse settings on a phone or tablet."},
  "settingsMobCustomizeKeys": "Customize keys",
