  "settingsMobKeepaliveHelpBody": "Sends a small packet to the server at regular intervals to prevent the connection from being closed due to inactivity.\n\nUseful when your server or network firewall drops idle connections. Set to \"Off\" if you don't experience disconnects.",
  "@settingsMobKeepaliveHelpBody": {"description": "Text in Settings, and in the Terminal settings."},
