  "connAgentKeyNotLoaded": "The key of this sign-in is not in the SSH agent any more. Load it into the agent again, or plug in the hardware key it is on, and connect again. No other way of signing in was tried in its place.",
  "@connAgentKeyNotLoaded": {"description": "Text while a terminal session connects or runs."},
