  "filesOnlyWatched": "This host's sessions are watched by its team, and a watched session gives no access to the host's files, so they cannot be opened here.",
  "@filesOnlyWatched": {"description": "Why the files of a host whose team watches its sessions (session moderation) cannot be opened: a watched session gives nothing beside its terminal."},
  "sftpOnlyRefusalTitle": "This host gives files only",
