  "lockoutCancelled": "The recovery is cancelled, and nothing on your account changed. ZestSSH has emailed you to confirm. Next, change the password of your email account, then your ZestSSH password if you have one: whoever asked had a code sent to your email address.",
  "@lockoutCancelled": {"description": "After This wasn't me cancelled a recovery: what to do next."},
  "lockoutNothingWaitingTitle": "No recovery was waiting",
  "@lockoutNothingWaitingTitle": {"description": "Title after This wasn't me when nothing was waiting any more."},
  "lockoutNothingWaiting": "No recovery was waiting any more: it was cancelled or ended already. If you did not ask for it, change the password of your email account, then your ZestSSH password if you have one.",
