  "storeHandoverStoreCopyOlder": "ZestSSH from the Microsoft Store is also on this PC, but it is older than this one, so this one stays for now. Update it in the Microsoft Store: once it is up to date, this one moves its hosts and keys over to it the next time it opens.",
  "@storeHandoverStoreCopyOlder": {"description": "Notice in the copy of ZestSSH from zestssh.com, at its start, where ZestSSH from the Microsoft Store is installed but is an older version: nothing is handed over to it (it might not read this copy's data) until the Store updates it, and this copy starts as it is. Said once for each older Store version."},
  "storeHandoverLastUsed": "Last used {date}, {time}",
  "@storeHandoverLastUsed": {"description": "Under each button of the question which data to keep (Windows, the Microsoft Store copy of ZestSSH, where both copies hold different data): when that set of data was last used (its newest file). {date} is a date. {time} is a time.", "placeholders": {"date": {"type": "DateTime", "format": "yMMMd"}, "time": {"type": "DateTime", "format": "jm"}}},
  "storeHandoverRemovedKeptStore": "ZestSSH from zestssh.com was removed from this PC. This one, from the Microsoft Store, kept its own data, as you chose, and keeps itself up to date.",
  "@storeHandoverRemovedKeptStore": {"description": "Notice in the Microsoft Store copy after it removed the copy from zestssh.com, where the person chose to keep the Microsoft Store copy's own data: the zestssh.com copy's data was set aside (a separate notice names where)."},
  "storeHandoverForAllAccounts": "ZestSSH from zestssh.com is installed for every account on this PC, so it was not removed: other accounts may use it. If no one does, remove it in Settings, Apps.",
  "@storeHandoverForAllAccounts": {"description": "Notice in the Microsoft Store copy where the copy from zestssh.com is installed for every Windows account on the PC (C:\\Program Files): it is not removed automatically, as other accounts may use it and removing it needs an administrator."},
  "storeHandoverSetAside": "The data you did not keep is set aside on this PC for 30 days, then deleted: {folders}.",
