  "@proxmoxConsoleNoAccount": {"description": "Why a Proxmox guest's console did not open: the Proxmox account the host was imported from is not kept on this device (accounts and their tokens stay on the device where they were added). Says what to do: add the account in Import hosts, From the cloud, Proxmox."},
  "proxmoxConsoleSignIn": "Proxmox refused the account's API token. Add the account again with a new token.",
