  "@keysExportSavedBesideBody": {"placeholders": {"file": {"type": "String"}}, "description": "Under the title, where a private key and its public key were both exported on a computer: the public key's file name (id_ed25519.pub), saved in the same folder, and the warning about the private key file."},
