  "welcomeTickSync": "Sync free through your own storage, and sign in later to join a team",
  "@welcomeTickSync": {"description": "Third tick on the welcome of a new install: sync through the person's own storage (WebDAV, S3, Google Drive, a server) is free and needs no account; signing in, later, lets them join a team. Hosted sync on ZestSSH Cloud is not free (it is part of Juiced)."},
